{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/42148-final-nights-an-original-world-of-darkness-forum","id":42148,"title":"Final Nights- An Original World of Darkness Forum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-03T21:50:47-08:00","id":42148,"title":"Final Nights- An Original World of Darkness Forum","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:mceinline\"><img src=\"http://finalnights.b1.jcink.com/uploads/finalnights/MockBanner.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:mceinline\"><i>The Empire State. The Big Apple. The City That Never Sleeps. No matter what you call it, darkness has always been the corner stone of New York City. It is the place where monsters and humans alike live side by side, the average mortal unaware of the supernatural inhabitants that lurk about, stalking the gutters and alleys.</i></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:mceinline\"><i>Werewolves, Vampires, Hunters and Mages roam about freely, each hiding their existence from prying mortal eyes. A thin truce keeps these creatures from raging all out war on the streets - but something somewhere will crack and break under the pressure and strain of the local politics happening around them.</i></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:mceinline\"><i>Where do you stand?</i></span> <b>Final Nights</b> is a modern day RP set in the World of Darkness universe created by White Wolf Publishing, and is open to both those familiar with and new to the setting. Will you uphold the truce and defend it? Are you just a bystander in the quake of the inevitable? Or are you pushing for that all out war? It's up for you to decide: New York awaits in these final nights.</div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:mceinline\"><a href=\"http://finalnights.b1.jcink.com\" target=\"_blank\">INDEX</a> || <a href=\"http://finalnights.b1.jcink.com/index.php?showtopic=2\" target=\"_blank\">RULES</a> || <a href=\"http://finalnights.b1.jcink.com/index.php?showtopic=4\" target=\"_blank\">PLOT</a></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1903-squeeji","name":"Squeeji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}